  <running_head>DE HOMINIS LIBERAT.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>Primum</catchword>
    <signature>N iij</signature>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">hostes protegit ac defendit{*}.</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="2" para="true">
      <i>Quid te confolatur reditus Christi ad iudican-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>dum vivos &amp; mortuos?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="4" para="true">Quod in omnibus miseriis &amp; persecutio-</l>
    <l n="5">nibus erecto capite, eundem illum, qui se prius</l>
    <l n="6">pro me iudicio Dei statuit, &amp; maledictionem</l>
    <l n="7">omnem a me abstulit, iudicem e coelo expecto,</l>
    <l n="8">{b}qui omnes suos &amp; meos hostes, in aeternas</l>
    <l n="9">poenas abiiciat{c}: me vero cum omnibus electis,</l>
    <l n="10">ad se in coelestia gaudia, &amp; sempiternam glori-</l>
    <l n="11">am traducat{d}.</l>
    <l n="12" type="heading" level="1" para="true">DE SPIRITU SANCTO.</l>
    <l n="13" type="heading" level="2" para="true">
      <i>Quid credis de Spiritu sancto?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" para="true">Primum quod sit verus &amp; coaeternus Deus</l>
    <l n="15">cum aeterno Patre &amp; Filio{e}: Deinde, quod mihi</l>
    <l n="16">quoque datus sit{f}, ut me per veram fidem Chri-</l>
    <l n="17">sti &amp; omnium eius beneficiorum participem</l>
    <l n="18">faciat{3}, me confoletur, &amp; mecum in aeternum</l>
    <l n="19">maneat{h}.</l>
    <l n="20" type="heading" level="2" para="true">
      <i>Quid credis de sancta &amp; catholica Christi</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>Ecclesia?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22" para="true">Credo Filium Dei{i}, ab initio mundi ad</l>
    <l n="23">finem usque{k}, sibi ex universo genere humano</l>
    <l n="24">coetum ad vitam aeternam electum{m}, per Spiri-</l>
    <l n="25">tum suum &amp; verbum{n}, in vera fide consentien-</l>
    <l n="26">tem{o} colligere, tueri, ac feruare{p}: neque</l>
    <l n="27">vivum eius coetus membrum esse{q}, &amp; perpetuo</l>
    <l n="28">manfurum{r}.</l>
    <l n="29" type="heading" level="2" para="true">
      <i>Quid sibi vult Communio sanctorum?</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
